      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway – 4.16m x 2.47m \r\nWooden front door with side glazed panels, marble tile floor, carpet runner on stairway, recessed lighting, decorative cornicing, under stair storage. \r\n\t \t\t \t\t \r\nLiving/Dining Room – 7.93m x 3.90m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, window shutter blinds, double doors to outside area, decorative wallpaper, open plan to kitchen dining. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining – 3.61m x 6.51m \r\nLaminate flooring, extensive fitted kitchen unit with integrated, fridge, dishwasher, Smeg range cooker with overhead extractor unit, tile splashback large centre island with extensive storage cupboards, integrated microwave and overhead downlights, large wall mirror, recessed lighting, window shutter blinds, double doors to lounge. \r\n\r\nLounge – 4.60m x 4.24m \r\nLaminate flooring, built-in gas fire with surround, two velux windows, large, fitted wall mirrors, decorative wall panelling, centre lights, pantry with shelving, feature stone wall cladding, double doors to kitchen. \r\n\r\nSunroom – 4.41m x 3.43m \r\nLaminate flooring, 3 panel sliding doors on either side to rear garden. \r\n\r\nSitting Room – 3.92m x 4.15m \r\nLaminate flooring, decorative corning, centre light with centre rose, extensive wall panelling, window shutter blinds, double doors to kitchen. \r\n\r\nOffice/Study – 3.51m x 2.99m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, extensive wall panelling, window shutter blinds. \r\n\r\nGround Floor Bathroom – 2.13m x 1.75m\r\nFully tiled wall and floor, power shower with overhead rainfall shower head, chrome heated towel rail, WC, WHB with underneath storage press, large wall mirror, recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nCloak Room/Utility Room – 3.60m x 2.97m \r\nWooden/tile floor, centre lights, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, door to rear garden, fitted units. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\n\r\nLanding Area – 4.18m x 2.81m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, stira stairs leading to overhead floored attic, built-in wardrobe unit with shelving. \r\n\t\r\nMaster Bedroom – 4.87m x 3.27m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, decorative wallpaper, sliding doors to walk-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe – 3.01m x 2.92m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, extensive built-in wardrobe and dresser units, window blind. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.92m x 3.21m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, shutter blinds. \r\n\r\nEn Suite – 2.84m x 0.90m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, electric shower unit with enclosure, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 3.58m x 2.87m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, decorative cornicing. \r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe – 1.6m x 0.91m\r\nFitted shelving, centre light, wooden floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 – 3.14m x 2.41m \r\nWooden floor, fluorescent light, decorative cornicing. \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom – 2.67m x 2.46m \r\nTile floor, matt black heated towel rail, free-standing bath unit, decorative wall panelling, large walk-in shower head with overhead rainfall shower head, WC, WHB unit, large centre globe light. \r\n\r\nEXTERIOR \r\n\r\nDetached Shed – 3.44m x 3.90m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, gas heating, sliding door, fully insulated with pitched roof.\r\n\r\nSelf-Contained Log Cabin \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining – 3.91m x 3.77m \r\nLaminate floor fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, gas hob, overhead extractor unit, centre lights. \r\n\r\nBathroom – 1.95m x 1.33m \r\nTile floor, WC, WHB, electric shower unit with enclosure, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nLiving Room – 2.80m x 3.77m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, window blind. \r\n\r\nBedroom – 3.77m x 3.8m \r\nLaminate floor, centre lights, window blind, door to private enclosed rear garden.\r\n\r\n***Joint Selling Agents With Michael Pigott Auctioneers & Valuers (021) 437 3300***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 208 sq metres (2238 sq ft)\r\nSuperb Detached Residence \r\nDriveway with parking for 6 cars\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nLarge South facing private rear garden \r\nSunroom \r\nDetached self-contained 2-bedroom Cabin (44m2)\r\nImmaculate condition throughout \r\nCCTV\r\nFully insulated\r\nBER B2 (Access to green mortgage) \r\nSolar panels with 9KW/H battery\r\nSash windows\r\nTimber window blinds/shutters\r\nStira leading to floored attic\r\n8ft external fireplace and dining area\r\n10 mins to Cork City Centre & 10 mins to Cork Airport"
